WEBVTT

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.440
Say, Yuusuke...

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.620
Any interest in continuin' to 
train here after the war's over?

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.410
With your talent, another five years...

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:23.290
nah, just two years, and you could 
be the best blacksmith around.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.260
I can't do that.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:33.290
For me, smithing skills are 
just a means to an end.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:37.340
Frankly, all that matters 
to me is achieving my goal.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:40.970
I see. That's a shame.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:25.730
She really is here...

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:26.900
The queen!

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:36.220
What do you want? I'm warming 
up to go for a swim.

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:37.520
You perverts.

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:48.590
<i>Humans are such foolish creatures.</i>

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.570
<i>You have far more intelligence than us orcs,</i>

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:56.020
<i>yet you don't realize your own weakness,</i>

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.950
<i>you forget about debts you owe...</i>

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:04.080
<i>and you desire battle.</i>

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.910
This is for Ryce!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.750
Our battle is for revenge!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:14.020
<i>You are barbaric and cruel.</i>

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.380
Fine!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.820
I will destroy you all, just as you wish!

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.150
<i>Shit! She's...</i>

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.220
Ouch!

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:41.470
That hurt!

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:43.640
Well, then...

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.620
How do you like this?!

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:50.460
<i>Uh-oh!</i>

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:55.000
<i>Oh, right!</i>

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.440
<i>That's where...</i>

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.750
Orc Queen!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.060
I challenge you.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:16.260
Damn it! He was protecting me!

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.340
Don't move.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:23.990
If only...

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.500
If only I were stronger...

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.950
Lolle...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:52.230
Two of them... showed up here.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:57.900
The three of us... managed 
to take out one of them...

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.670
And the other one?

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:02.180
It ran away, wounded,

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:04.210
and Thanza-san went after it.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.780
Do you know which way they went?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.750
No... I'm sorry.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.860
So what do we do now?

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:16.150
We can't scatter. It's too risky.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:18.970
Let's all head to the 
blacksmith's shop together.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:22.850
What?

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:26.010
We can't use the bullets that Gramps made?

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:30.120
In general, players can only use weapons 
that are part of their own gear.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:34.240
Things Yotsuya-kun makes with his Blacksmith 
skills are different, but these...

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.500
Didn't we explain that to you?

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.110
Oh, yeah, sorry. I forgot.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:42.790
Master, will it be ready?

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:46.050
No, the furnace ain't done heatin' up yet.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:46.870
Hero.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.340
We gotta get the wounded 
to the Väikedaam cave.

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.420
Go.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:02.700
Leave things here to Majiha Blue, 
the cool lady who never misses!

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:05.000
Oh, you changed jobs.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.330
Wait, you just noticed <i>now</i>?!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:12.050
We heroes can't use the 
bullets that Gramps makes.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:19.430
But the people of the island can, right?

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:25.360
If we just have the islanders 
load the bullets,

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.910
we can still fire the Orc Eater.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.310
It won't be a problem.

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.320
Can someone...

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:36.390
I'll stay.

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:40.490
Thank you!

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:43.950
Nah, you did cheer me on.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.470
And that rice ball was tasty...

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.960
Yeah, they were delicious.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.150
She's the goddess of rice balls.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.660
Keep her safe!

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:59.170
Yeah, you'd better!

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:00.240
I know you can do it!

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.290
Everyone...

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:03.570
Fear the naturally-soothing types...

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.560
All right! That settles it!

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.360
You'll wait here,

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.220
and the rest of you will head for 
the Väikedaam cave with us!

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:10.730
Right!

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:13.700
Hey, that was pretty smooth, right?

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:14.360
Huh?

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:19.650
Man, if only Iu were here, 
that totally would've won her over!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.610
<i>He's an idiot. A huge idiot.</i>

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:35.260
You challenge me, then you 
have the nerve to run away?

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.160
And you call yourself a warrior?

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.000
Fine. I'll play with you.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.900
Just as we planned.

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.170
You're awake?

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:53.430
What is this place?

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:56.040
The island's sacred ground, 
the Väikedaam cave.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:59.090
There's no danger here. You can relax.

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:08.910
Where are Yotsuya-san and the others?!

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:11.090
Ya shouldn't be gettin' up yet.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:14.020
They headed out already...

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.280
to Kumamo Castle.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:28.560
<i>There are probably only a few 
orcs left in the castle.</i>

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:30.410
<i>Can we take them with our numbers?</i>

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:33.530
Let's do this, boys!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:33.910
Huh?

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:37.880
Hey, wait a—

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:42.380
All of you! Follow me!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:45.290
We're gonna beat those orcs!

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:51.590
He's...

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.030
Wind!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:20.690
There!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:23.800
<i>She fell for it!</i>

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.700
Where are you? Stop sneaking around!

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:27.630
Now!

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.470
Why now?

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.070
An earthquake?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.050
No... It's...

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.900
The island god...

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.570
...is angry.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.730
Whoa, this is huge!

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:51.750
Really huge! Super huge!

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.690
It can't be...

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:06.000
m 0 0 l 260 0 l 260 200 l 0 200

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:06.000
<b>[Jiffon Island]</b>

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:06.000
An island located between the continents of Meri and 
Illa, about seven days' travel from the international
harbor of Radodorbo by boat. Because of its frequent
earthquakes and periodic volcanic eruptions, it is also
known as "Disaster Island." The Jiffon people came to
the island 900 years ago while fleeing slavery, hoping
to find a paradise free of  fighting.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.010
Sorry... Of all the times...

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:14.180
Don't be sorry.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.260
How could this be?

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.300
Seems like the shaking's stopped.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.260
But what really scares me is...

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:52.340
Quickly, get outside! Hurry!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.730
Aoiu-san!

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.330
Don't, Aoiu! The ceiling's gonna...

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:03.640
There are still wounded in here!

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:12.330
Aoiu!

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.100
Aoiu! Aoiu!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.720
Yana-chan, it's too dangerous!

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.150
If you get too close now—

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.210
Volcanic bombs!

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:33.390
Keep your heads down and keep moving!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:36.130
<b>Dead</b>

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:36.130
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:36.130
<b>Torii Keita</b>

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:43.030
Sorry, Yuusuke. Can you help me out?

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:51.260
Huh? Hey... Carry me a little 
more carefully, will you?

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.320
<i>It's erupting?</i>

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:00.870
<i>And that earthquake was really big...</i>

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.050
<i>Wait...</i>

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:09.200
Iu!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.000
Iu!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.180
<b>Dead</b>

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.180
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.180
<b>Shindou Iu</b>

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:23.170
Shit, shit! I got distracted!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:27.940
Oh, damn it! I can't revive 
if I'm stuck in the ocean!

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:35.440
The water is receding...

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:38.340
What?

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:45.340
Did the sea floor collapse 
in all that shaking?

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:46.440
No!

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:49.130
Well, no matter. Let us continue.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:50.510
Indeed.

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:53.110
She's wrong! You have to run, Cantil-san!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.280
This isn't just low tide!

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:56.720
It's...

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.350
a tsunami warning sign!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.380
It's coming. One of those... is coming.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:13.050
One of... what?

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:14.510
The White Wall.

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:15.710
White Wall?

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.780
What is that?

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:29.660
<i>Hear our song of rituals and miso</i>

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:30.860
Yana-san?

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:37.080
<i>Dumplings of music from the eastern isle</i>

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.080
Oh... Of course.

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:42.460
<i>The earth shakes, my feelings burst</i>

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.340
This song...

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:49.460
<i>Plow the fields, heave-ho</i>

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:49.290
The memory of the calamity that 
struck this island 800 years ago...

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:55.510
<i>The white wall strikes the withered shore</i>

00:13:55.800 --> 00:14:00.150
<i>The mountain god blasts a 
pillar of red in his fury</i>

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:06.080
<i>The sea god will devour 
you along with the shore</i>

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:10.630
<i>Climb, climb, to the top of the mountain</i>

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:16.570
<i>When the white wall turns black</i>

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:21.660
<i>It will feast on all, 
starting with the lowest</i>

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.920
It's swallowing the whole island...

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:28.940
<i>The blood of the earth pours down like rain</i>

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:23.520
Darling!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:28.310
You have to live!

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:30.820
Darling!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:38.320
<i>The man remaining in the 
valley returns to the earth</i>

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:45.070
<i>Hear our song of rituals and miso</i>

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:50.480
<i>Dumplings of music from the eastern isle</i>

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:55.570
<i>The earth flows, my feelings burst</i>

00:14:55.570 --> 00:15:01.120
<i>Plow the fields, heave-ho</i>

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.120
Finally made it...

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:06.050
<i>The blessings of the earth will 
become my flesh and blood</i>

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:11.330
<i>And I will devour you</i>

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:16.320
<i>On this island inhabited by the gods</i>

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:24.410
<i>We offer this song to you</i>

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:32.940
I remembered that there was a secret 
passage under the Väikedaam cave.

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:36.200
Thanks to the mine carts in 
there, I got everyone out.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.170
I'm glad you're okay.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:40.300
What part of the castle is this?

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:42.750
The east side of the castle, 
on the first floor.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:43.620
Where are the orcs?

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.850
Probably on the next floor up.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:48.100
Aoiu! We've got trouble!

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:57.520
The White Wall swept away all the 
houses and fields along the shore.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:59.210
It's the gods' punishment!

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:05.430
The gods are outraged 'cause we thought 
we could defeat the orcs on our own!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.310
We're done for.

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:10.940
Whether we beat the orcs 
or not, we'll never...

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:14.370
Whoa, hang on! How can you say 
that after we've come this far?

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:21.770
What are you doin'?

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:25.530
I guess this isn't nearly 
enough force to budge it.

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:29.920
Aoiu-san, the Väikedaam are also 
the island's historians, right?

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.090
Yeah, that's right.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:35.850
We're also the storytellers who 
pass down the island's history.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:39.260
Then do you know where this 
castle's weakness is?

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.700
Weakness?

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:44.380
Like a weak point in its construction.

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.980
The kind that, if broken,

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:49.900
could bring down the whole castle at once.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.820
Wh-What are you sayin'?

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:56.230
We'll bring down the whole castle 
to kill all the orcs inside.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:03.780
I tried to think of other ways to 
use this eruption for an attack,

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.690
but our enemies are on the second floor.

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:08.550
The volcanic bombs won't reach them,

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:13.070
and to reroute lava to flow into the 
castle, we'd need to dig trenches.

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:15.590
As it stands right now, 
that won't be possible.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:22.460
One insane idea after another... 
Are you a demon lord now?

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:26.600
So the optimal choice right now is to 
destroy the castle along with the—

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.100
We can't do that!

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:30.310
This castle is the symbol of the island!

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.620
But you don't use it anymore, right?

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:33.520
So...

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:35.460
It can't be destroyed, anyway!

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:37.380
It was built 400 years ago!

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:40.120
We've had tons of earthquakes 
and eruptions in that time,

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.250
and yet it still stands!

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:46.380
Our ancestors poured all their wisdom and 
ingenuity into buildin' this castle!

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:48.460
It doesn't have any weaknesses!

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:50.850
I see. Okay.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:51.540
Huh?

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:56.540
Then I'll try to find a spot where 
we can fight with an advantage.

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.310
He's like a machine, isn't he?

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:05.420
A machine that only does what's 
necessary to achieve its goal.

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:08.140
Seriously, what pleasure does 
he even get out of life?

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.990
He's gotta be a virgin.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:19.870
For me, smithing skills are 
just a means to an end.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:24.040
Frankly, all that matters 
to me is achieving my goal.

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:25.870
How...

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:33.060
How can you keep goin' on just 
for the sake of your goal?

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:35.790
Even when it means sacrificin' yourself?!

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:39.320
You just need to know your own limits.

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:44.480
If you have a clear goal, what's the 
problem with just taking action?

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.950
There's no meaning in the process,

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:49.390
if you're only working for 
the sake of your goal.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:56.450
If you realize that you're all but 
powerless to achieve your goal,

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:59.990
you'll know right away that you 
can't afford to stand still.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:03.190
See? Nothing he says makes 
any damn sense, right?

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.710
It really doesn't make sense.

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:08.830
But there's one thing...

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:12.330
Just one thing I understand clearly now.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:17.350
We don't have time to stand 
still and do nothing.

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:34.090
It's been said since old times on this island 
that you should never build on low ground.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:40.450
But we started buildin' houses along the 
shore 'cause there wasn't much land.

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:44.410
We thought more people, 
more fields, and more wealth

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.180
meant the island was prosperous.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:52.070
We let our immediate greed get 
the better of us and forgot.

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:53.330
So pathetic...

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:57.570
No paradise is achieved without hard work.

00:19:57.570 --> 00:20:00.950
The island's history, its wisdom, its pride...

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:07.690
As the island's storytellers, we Väikedaam 
should've communicated that better...

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.020
It's true. We were wrong.

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:14.790
We neglected the legends that have 
been handed down for generations,

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:17.120
and we lost our homes and our fields.

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:19.210
But...

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:21.900
If our homes are destroyed,

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:24.660
we just need to build sturdier ones.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.460
If our fields are washed away,

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:28.880
we just need to make the 
next ones higher up.

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:31.790
We people of Jiffon have always worked

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:34.700
to refine our knowledge and 
skills for that very purpose!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.860
Even if there ain't much land or resources,

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:43.570
our ancestors made up for it with 
diligence and technical prowess!

